Also note `formatMoney` with `−` minus (U+2212). Fine.

Order dialog summary text. Include order id and total and item count.

Toast messages: add `"Auriculares Aurora" añadido al carrito`.

Also maybe show quantity.

Storage save on every increment; fine.

